k 38:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,17)\">Ezek 38:17</ref> = <highlight>for years</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְקֵץ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 11:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,6)\">Dan 11:6</ref> <bdbheb>זֶהיָֿמִים אוֺ זֶה שָׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,29,3)\">1Sam 29:3</ref> specifically <bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת מוֺת הַמֶּלֶח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 6:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,6,1)\">Isa 6:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 14:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,28)\">Isa 14:28</ref>, <bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת בֹּא תַּרְתָּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 20:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,1)\">Isa 20:1</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁנַת הַשְּׁמִטָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 15:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,9)\">Deut 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,10)\">Deut 31:10</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁנַת הַיּוֺבֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,13)\">Lev 25:13</ref> +, etc.; <bdbheb>שְׁנֵי שָׂכִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 16:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,14)\">Isa 16:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 21:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,16)\">Isa 21:16</ref> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>שָׂכִיר</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>שְׁנַת פְּקֻדָּתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 11:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,23)\">Jer 11:23</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רָצוֺן לְי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 61:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,2)\">Isa 61:2</ref>, etc.; <bdbheb>שְׁנוֺת דֹּרוָֿדֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,7)\">Deut 32:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Joel 2:2\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,2)\">Joel 2:2</ref> most often with cardinal numbers: plural after units, apposition, <ref ref=\"Exod 21:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,2)\">Exod 21:2</ref> +, so also <bdbheb>שְׁתַּיִם שְׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 2:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,2,10)\">2Sam 2:10</ref> +, but dual <bdbheb>שְׁנָתַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 1:1\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(30,1,1)\">Amos 1:1</ref> + 4 t., <bdbheb>שְׁנָתַיִם יָמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 41:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,1)\">Gen 41:1</ref> + 4 t.; very rarely with number (certainly) construct <bdbheb>שְׁתֵּי שָׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,1)\">1Sam 13:1</ref> (corrupt), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁלשׁ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,21)\">Lev 25:21</ref> 8 + <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,1)\">2Kgs 22:1</ref> before unit (rare, late) <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,17)\">2Chr 11:17</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Dan 1:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,5)\">Dan 1:5</ref> singular after 11-19, tens and hundreds <ref ref=\"Gen 5:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,3)\">Gen 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 5:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,9)\">Gen 5:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 14:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,4)\">Gen 14:4</ref> + often; so 90 + 9 <highlight>years</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 17:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,24)\">Gen 17:24</ref> +, rarely 30 + 3 <highlight>years</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,11)\">1Kgs 2:11</ref>, etc.; but <bdbheb>אֶלֶף שָׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 90:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"90\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"90\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,90,4)\">Ps 90:4</ref> 1000 <highlight>years</highlight>, so (+ <bdbheb>פַּעֲמַיִם</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Eccl 6:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,6)\">Eccl 6:6</ref> 1000 <highlight>years twice over</highlight>; with compare number often repeated, 900 <highlight>year</highlight> + 30 <highlight>year</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 5:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,5,5)\">Gen 5:5</ref>, etc.; 100 <highlight>year</highlight> + 70 <highlight>year</highlight> + 5 <highlight>years</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,7)\">Gen 25:7</ref>, etc.; with cardinal number = ordinal, <bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת אַרְבַּע לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:41\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,41)\">1Kgs 22:41</ref> <highlight>in the fourth year of</highlight>, etc., also <bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת חֲמִשִּׁים שָׁנָה לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,23)\">2Kgs 15:23</ref>, etc.; but <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּאַרְבַּע עֶשְׂרֵה שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,13)\">2Kgs 18:13</ref>, etc. (often), and <bdbheb>בַּשָּׁנָה הָאַחַת עֶשְׂרֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,38)\">1Kgs 6:38</ref>, etc.; also (c. units), <bdbheb>בַּשָּׁנָה הָֽרְבִיעִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:24\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,24)\">Lev 19:24</ref> +, etc., + <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,6)\">2Kgs 17:6</ref> <highlight>the ninth year of</highlight>, etc.; and even (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:134p»§ 134p</sup>) <bdbheb>בִּשְׁנַת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַתְּשִׁיעִית לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,1)\">2Kgs 25:1</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,8)\">Ezra 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,2)\">Jer 46:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:59\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,59)\">Jer 51:59</ref> + (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Jer 28:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,28,1)\">Jer 28:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,1)\">Jer 32:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>בַּשָּׁנָה</bdbheb>). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Amos 2:10", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 41:50", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 50}, {"raw": "Ezek 46:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 46, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Lev 14:10", "book": "